WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:06.788
Connection one. Greece, and the Greek Islands.

2
00:00:08.497 --> 00:00:11.340
From the Blue Ridge to the Aegean Sea.

3
00:00:18.531 --> 00:00:28.100
Three nights in Santorini, where whitewashed Oia hangs above the caldera, and every evening ends in a sunset the whole island stops to watch.

4
00:00:35.064 --> 00:00:42.652
Then an island flight and a ferry to Mykonos, for three nights of windmills, harbour lanes, and Little Venice at dusk.

5
00:00:53.059 --> 00:00:58.969
And two nights in Athens, with a guided tour beneath the Acropolis, where so much of it began.

6
00:01:11.155 --> 00:01:17.099
Eight nights for two. Four-star hotels, breakfast every day, and the island flight and ferry.

7
00:01:20.002 --> 00:01:24.174
Choose your trip at the Gala. Every journey connects back home.
